stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Admission
    Admission --> HintSnapshot: confirmed Missing and no process
    Admission --> ObserveLegacy: live legacy direct TUI
    HintSnapshot --> WakeOnce: exact hint cleanup
    ObserveLegacy --> Refused: unsupported or unknown owner or shell remains
    ObserveLegacy --> HandoffWaiting: busy or draft or modal
    ObserveLegacy --> LiteralIntent: verified empty idle and pinned identity
    LiteralIntent --> EnterIntent: literal on same target
    EnterIntent --> HandoffWaiting: exact draft and same target
    LiteralIntent --> Refused: replaced or cancelled
    EnterIntent --> Refused: changed draft or identity
    HandoffWaiting --> ObserveLegacy: ready and no write intent
    HandoffWaiting --> HintSnapshot: exact Ended confirmed
    HandoffWaiting --> HandoffWaiting: restart observes only
    WakeOnce --> Pending: fresh vacancy and owner rechecked
    Pending --> StartupBound: existing successful launch contract
    StartupBound --> DeliveredOnce
    Refused --> OriginalRetainedAndNotified
